{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026lsNzChm48u1794657739.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>達卡青奧滑浪風帆銀牌得主吳海迪凱旋。</p><p></p><p>15歲的吳海迪戴著銀牌步出機場，他在達卡青奧14場比賽中，有兩場第一、三場第二及四場第三，輸冠軍希臘代表16分，仍奪得銀牌。他之後與滑浪風帆其他隊員合照。</p><p></p><p>今次是港隊相隔16年再獲青奧滑浪風帆獎牌，追平鄭俊樑2010年銀牌成績。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T13:05:27.051099+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T12:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T15:20:18.748078+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T12:58:41.509032+00:00","content_hash":"edc9bfcae6d4e4da2d4a3c3de3ff6c8f3eaeaff638b2bce7b6c23e284addab48","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T13:05:27.051099+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}